    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area : 94.86 sqm\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 4 Castleknock Laurels to the market. This wonderful, three bedroomed family home is ideally located in this much sought after, mature residential area, just minutes walk from the village of Castleknock.\n\nThis is an extremely well-proportioned family home which presents in good condition throughout. At ground floor level, the accommodation briefly comprises of entrance porch leading into the entrance hall, living/dining room, kitchen. Upstairs there are three spacious bedrooms with the main benefiting from an ensuite, a family bathroom completes.\n\nCastleknock Laurels is just a short stroll from an excellent array of local shops and facilities at Laurel Lodge as well as just a 15 minute walk to Castleknock Village, where there is a variety of shops, restaurants and bars. There is also a good selection of schools nearby, such as Scoil Thomas Primary School, Castleknock Community College, Mount Sackville girls and Castleknock College. Castleknock Train Station is less than a 10 minute walk and there is an excellent bus service (No. 37) also, providing easy access to the city centre and further afield. \n\nViewing is highly recommended on this wonderful family home, which is sure to impress.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 1.55m (5'1\") x 1.85m (6'1\")\nwith lino flooring, double door access\n\nEntrance Hallway - 3.9m (12'10\") x 2.1m (6'11\")\nwith carpet floor, alarm panel, understair storage\n\nLounge - 8m (26'3\") x 3.55m (11'8\")\nwith carpet floor, feature fireplace with timber surround and electric inset. Double doors to the rear garden\n\nKitchen - 4m (13'1\") x 2.55m (8'4\")\nwith a range of floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback, fridge freezer, dishwasher, oven, hob & extractor fan, access onto the rear garden\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.23m (13'11\") x 3m (9'10\")\nwith carpet floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 1.65m (5'5\") x 0.95m (3'1\")\nshower cubicle with electric shower, partially tiled walls, tiled floor, WHB\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.06m (10'0\") x 3.45m (11'4\")\nwith carpet floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3m (9'10\") x 2.65m (8'8\")\nwith laminate wood floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.75m (5'9\") x 2.2m (7'3\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., & bath with electric shower, vanity unit, fully tiled\n\nLanding - 3.05m (10'0\") x 2.2m (7'3\")\nwith carpet flooring, access to attic, hotpress\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
